#: R/texts.R
msgid ""
"It does not usually bias predictions, but it can make coefficients "
"unstable, widen standard errors and make it harder to interpret each "
"predictor individually."
msgstr ""
"No suele sesgar las predicciones, pero puede volver inestables los "
