"The 'brant' package is not installed, so the proportional-odds assumption "
"could not be tested. Install it (install.packages(\"brant\")) to enable this "
"check - it is the central assumption of this model family and should not be "
"skipped in a final analysis."
msgstr ""
"El paquete 'brant' no está instalado, así que no se pudo probar el supuesto "
"de momios proporcionales. Instálelo (install.packages(\"brant\")) para "
"habilitar esta revisión - es el supuesto central de esta familia de modelos "
"y no debería omitirse en un análisis final."

#: R/anovacheck.b.R
#: R/regcheck.b.R
msgid "The 'copent' package is not installed."
msgstr "El paquete 'copent' no está instalado."

#: R/pathcheck.b.R
msgid ""
"The 'copent' package is not installed; this section could not be computed. "
"Install it with install.packages('copent')."
msgstr ""
"El paquete 'copent' no está instalado; esta sección no pudo calcularse. "
