msgid ""
"The 'rugarch' package is not installed; the GARCH fit and its post-fit "
"diagnostics were skipped."
msgstr ""
"El paquete 'rugarch' no está instalado; se omitieron el ajuste GARCH y sus "
"diagnósticos posteriores."

#: R/timecheck.b.R
msgid ""
"The 'strucchange' package is not installed; the OLS-CUSUM stability test "
